<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Credit Lyonnais analyst Matheus Tarzia reiterated a buy recommendation for Venezuelan telephone company CANTV citing first quarter of 1997 results above market expectations.</p>
<p>- The ADR target price to year end is $37, Tarzia said. In morning trade, the stock rose 1/4 to 33-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
